        </p>

        <div class="nexa-ai-badges">
          <span>Live catalogue</span>
          <span>Real inventory</span>
          <span>Grounded results</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="nexa-ai-orb" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="nexa-ai-orb-inner">
          N
